# Deny by default, including unknown backup/configuration file formats.
**
!**/*.js
!public/**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!LICENSE

# Deny directories AND descendants: a JS exception can re-include a child otherwise.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.forgejo
**/.forgejo/**
**/.github
**/.github/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/data
**/data/**
**/tls
**/tls/**
**/secrets
**/secrets/**
**/backups
**/backups/**
**/recovery
**/recovery/**
**/docs
**/docs/**
**/work
**/work/**
**/test
**/test/**
**/tests
**/tests/**
**/test-support
**/test-support/**
**/scripts
**/scripts/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/graphify-out
**/graphify-out/**
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.js

# These must stay excluded even if accidentally placed under public/.
**/.*
**/.*/**
**/.env
**/.env/**
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.npmrc/**
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.der
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_*
**/*.bak
**/*.old
**/*.log
**/*.zip
**/*.tar*
**/*.gz
**/*.sql
**/compose*.yaml
**/compose*.yml
